{
  "title": "ISic030039. Lead lamina",
  "body": "<div id=\"editions\"><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag</div><div id=\"edition-interpretive\" lang=\"grc\">  <span class=\"textpartnumber\" id=\"aba\">face a</span>  <div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"diva--interpretive\">  <a id=\"aa-l1-interpretive\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span>Εὐο̄πίδας hιάλε̄ <br id=\"aa-l2-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span>Διεύχε̄ς ⁚ λοχαγὸς <br id=\"aa-l3-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span>Δαῖτις </span></div>  <p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag</div><div id=\"edition-diplomatic\" lang=\"grc\"><span class=\"textpartnumber\" id=\"aba\">face a</span><div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"diva--diplomatic\"><a id=\"aa-l1-diplomatic\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span>ΕΥΟ̄ΠΙΔΑΣHΙΑΛΕ̄<br id=\"aa-l2-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span>ΔΙΕΥΧΕ̄Σ:ΛΟΧΑΓΟΣ<br id=\"aa-l3-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span>ΔΑΙΤΙΣ</span></div><p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div></div>  <div id=\"facsimile-images\"><h2>Facsimile Images</h2></div>  <div id=\"apparatus\"><h4>Apparatus criticus</h4><ul><li><span>  <span>Text Dubois, Arena</span>  </span></li></ul></div>  <div id=\"translation\"><h2>English translation</h2><p class=\"translation-author\">  </p><p>  </p></div>  <div id=\"translation\"><h2>Italian translation</h2><p class=\"translation-author\">  </p><p>  </p></div>  <div id=\"commentary\"><h2>commentary</h2>  <p>Whether a letter (as suggested by Mani Piraino), or part of a defixio (so, speculatively, Jordan) is unclear. Dubois and Arena report text (a) only.</p>  </div>  <div id=\"bibliography\"><h2>bibliography</h2>  <ul><li> Manni Piraino 1976 681 no.45, tav.CXVI.1 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002467\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002467</a></li><li> Jordan 1985 177-178 (unnumbered) <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001391\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001391</a></li><li> Dubois 1989 <a href=\"http://www.persee.fr/doc/efr_0000-0000_1989_cat_119_1\" target=\"_blank\">11</a>  <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000187\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000187</a></li><li> Arena 1994 51 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000282\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000282</a></li><li> Curbera 1999 181 no. 51 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002060\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002060</a></li></ul>  <ul><li></li></ul>  </div>  <div id=\"handnote\">  Line 1  3-6  </div><div id=\"license\"> Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence. </div>",
